1. Definitions

"Licensor" means Seungwoo Hong, doing business as Baryon Labs, and any
successor or assignee of the copyright in the Software, including a
corporation to which the copyright is transferred.

"Software" means the source code, object code, documentation, and other
material in this repository that is made available under this license.

"You" means the individual or the Legal Entity exercising rights under this
license.

"Legal Entity" means a company, partnership, government body, institution,
association, or other organization, together with every entity that controls,
is controlled by, or is under common control with it ("Affiliates"). Control
means direct or indirect ownership of more than 50% of the voting interests or
the power to direct management.

"Headcount" means the total number of natural persons who work for a Legal
Entity and its Affiliates, including employees, officers, and individual
contractors or freelancers working for it on a substantially full-time basis,
counted at any time during the period of use.

"Production Use" means any use of the Software other than Evaluation.

"Evaluation" means installing and using the Software solely to test whether
it meets Your needs, with no more than 30 consecutive days of use per Legal
Entity, and without serving end users in the course of business.

