  (b) a Legal Entity whose Headcount is fewer than ten (10) persons; or

  (c) any person or Legal Entity performing Evaluation.

3. When a commercial license is required

You must obtain a separate commercial license from the Licensor before any
Production Use of the Software if You are, or You use the Software on behalf
of, a Legal Entity whose Headcount is ten (10) persons or more. This includes
use by a contractor, integrator, or consultant who installs or operates the
Software for such a Legal Entity.

A Legal Entity that becomes ineligible under Section 2 because its Headcount
reaches ten (10) persons may continue its existing Production Use for ninety
(90) days, during which it must obtain a commercial license or stop
Production Use.

